 meanwhile, had a history as runner-up at these tournaments that was almost as strong as Russia’s winning streak."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Competition in the team event was tighter than it had been in the duet, but the Russians still came out on top in both the technical and free routine portions of the tournament. China was not far behind, however, and came in a very close second overall. The bronze medal went to Ukraine, who had earlier won their first medal in the sport by coming in third in the duet, while the defending bronze medalists from Japan were able to manage only fourth."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {} "Technical Routine"] [:th {} "Free Routine"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "ROC"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ROC"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ROC.png"}] "ROC"]] [:td {} "196.0979"] [:td {} "97.2979 (1)"] [:td {} "98.8000 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "11"} [:a {:href "/athletes/131617"} "Vlada Chigiryova"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/146180"} "Marina Golyadkina"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/131616"} "Svetlana Kolesnichenko"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/146181"} "Polina Komar"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/120460"} "Aleksandra Patskevich"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/116137"} "Svetlana Romashina"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/120462"} "Alla Shishkina"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/131615"} "Mariya Shurochkina"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "People's Republic of China"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} "193.5310"] [:td {} "96.2310 (2)"] [:td {} "97.